  usecase "SFR003: Request financial predictions from the AI component to provide users with forward-looking financial insights" as SFR003
  usecase "FAFR002: View predictive analytics about my clients' financial situations to provide data-driven recommendations during consultations" as FAFR006
  
  CFR001 --> (View Financial Insights Dashboard)
  SAFR002 --> (Manage Analysis Parameters)
  FAFR003 --> (Configure analysis parameters for specific client segments)
}

